  <!-- Seeed reComputer Industrial (J30/J40 series), v227. Seeed wiki: 159 (W, port face) x 155 (D) x 57 (H) mm, 1.57 kg.
       Shapes from meshes/ref/recomputer_ref*.png; meshes from meshes/gen_recomputer.py (link frame).
       Port face = +X. Footprint: x -0.0795 (back, touching mast as before) .. +0.0755 (D 155), y +/-0.0795 (W 159),
       z -0.025 (bottom on pc mounts) .. +0.032 (fin tips) = 57 mm. Link origin unchanged so the mounts stay put.
       Chassis: R7 rounded-rect, 28 mm + 1 mm reveal; heatsink: 3 mm plate + 27 x 2 mm fins (pitch 6.04 mm), 25 mm, running
       front-to-back (along X, perpendicular to the port face), stacked across Y; 4-vertex chamfered fin tops,
       outer fins stepped down at the +/-Y sides, 45 deg top chamfer at the fin ends (clears clip).
       Green 90 deg L-bracket with triangular notch on the +Y side near the port-face (+X) corner (v226). -->
  <link name="pc">
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/>
      <geometry><mesh filename="meshes/recomputer_chassis.stl?v=304" scale="1 1 1"/></geometry>
