    <!-- v227 I/O ports (meshes/gen_recomputer_ports.py; chassis pockets cut in gen_recomputer.py), from James's port diagram:
         +Y face = diagram LEFT panel (LAN1+PSE, LAN2, HDMI, USB-C Debug, USB-C Device, Recovery, SIM, DC-In 2-pin);
         -Y face = diagram RIGHT panel (Run/Power LEDs, Reset, COM DB9, USB-A, stacked USB-A, DI/DO/CAN 2x8 block).
